## VERDICT ON RESCAN
  No in-session path made Logic 11.2 index a newly installed AU: not time, not auval, not restarting the
  registrar, not the Plug-in Manager's selection rescan. Logic builds its AU list at launch. A "Full Audio Unit
  Reset" is worse than a plain restart: it throws away every validation result and revalidates all AUs.
  Rule for the BUILD limb: install, then restart Logic (plain quit/relaunch, project saved) — do NOT use
  Full Audio Unit Reset.

